ents, and future linguists[14]. [15]For Hale, the project is less about preserving a museum piece than about honoring a living, if fading, way of speaking[15].',
    questionText: '[underlined: For Hale, the project is less about preserving a museum piece than about honoring a living, if fading, way of speaking]',
    options: [
