      'It would strengthen Scientist 2\'s original objection less, since a much shorter volcanic timescale would become easier, not harder, to reconcile with the extinction\'s rapid onset, weakening rather than strengthening that particular objection',
      'It would weaken Scientist 1\'s argument, since much of that argument relies on the eruptions unfolding gradually over a long period',
      'It would prove conclusively that an asteroid impact, not volcanism, caused the extinction',
